{"ID":"20240205153852-j5j7ry5","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153852-j5j7ry5","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153852-j5j7ry5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205164206-8mq6vtj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205164215-sxb25u4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205164206-8mq6vtj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"竹茹","type":"doc","updated":"20240902144622"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206114326-cwojx0q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206114326-cwojx0q","updated":"20240206114329"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产中南、华东、西南地区。\n【性状】\t本品呈不规则的丝状或薄带状，常卷曲扭缩而缠结成团或作创花状，长短不一，宽0.50.7cm，厚0.30.5cm。全体淡黄白色、浅绿色、青黄色、灰黄色、灰黄绿色、黄而韧，有弹性。气稍清香，味微甜。\n【性味】\t甘，微寒。\n【功效】\t清热化痰，除烦止呕。用于痰热咳嗽、胆火挟痰、烦热呕吐、惊悸失眠、中风痰迷、舌强不语、胃热呕吐、妊娠恶阻、胎动不安。\n【炙品】\t姜竹茹：竹茹用姜汁拌匀后再炒至黄色者。长于化痰止呕。"}]},{"ID":"20240206114322-ndjsrns","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206114322-ndjsrns","updated":"20240206114322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206114322-ac7hya3.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205164215-sxb25u4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205164215-sxb25u4","updated":"20240205164215"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"竹茹"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/竹茹-20240205164215-4fwbef3.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240712083625-237ozo5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240712083625-237ozo5","updated":"20240712083625"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240712083625-cmkpcg3.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240712084252-ynt0e62","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240712084252-ynt0e62","updated":"20240712085047"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"竹茹1"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/竹茹1-20240712084253-96ingb4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 339px;","style":"width: 329px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"竹茹2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/竹茹2-20240712084459-aloqriv.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 329px;\" parent-style=\"width: 339px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 348px;","style":"width: 338px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"竹茹"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/竹茹-20240712085047-3bbdx62.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 338px;\" parent-style=\"width: 348px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240712082920-0wycf9z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240712082920-0wycf9z","updated":"20240712082920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 574px;","style":"width: 564px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"竹子 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/竹子 1-20240712082600-bwyavp5.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 564px;\" parent-style=\"width: 574px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 644px;","style":"width: 634px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"竹子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/竹子-20240712082514-yfgo7zw.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 634px;\" parent-style=\"width: 644px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240712082920-evogh1r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240712082920-evogh1r","updated":"20240712082920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 560px;","style":"width: 550px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"竹子 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/竹子 2-20240712082721-jzuac0b.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 550px;\" parent-style=\"width: 560px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 499px;","style":"width: 489px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"竹子 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/竹子 3-20240712082745-u28polh.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 489px;\" parent-style=\"width: 499px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240712082920-dvn4hdf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240712082920-dvn4hdf","updated":"20240712082920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 429px;","style":"width: 419px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"竹林"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/竹林-20240702132749-s8q4bxq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 419px;\" parent-style=\"width: 429px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 639px;","style":"width: 629px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"竹叶2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/竹叶2-20240626082356-8xqrpac.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 629px;\" parent-style=\"width: 639px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240712083207-dktou5e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240712083207-dktou5e","updated":"20240712083733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：竹茹就是竹子青皮底下刮出来的竹丝。（取竹茹的时候要先把竹子外面那层‘竹青’去掉）"}]},{"ID":"20240712083132-d2yhyh0","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240712083132-d2yhyh0"}},{"ID":"20240902144615-ckhvtjx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-ckhvtjx","updated":"20240902144622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：竹茹"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-vm9lrni","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-vm9lrni","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"竹茹《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-jb7z7i7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-jb7z7i7","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】ZhúRú"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-aitd6xf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-aitd6xf","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】CAULISBAMBUSAEINTAENIA"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-lyg83yj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-lyg83yj","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】本品为禾本科植物青秆竹BambusatuldoidesMunro、大头典竹Sinocalamusbeecheyanus（Munro）Mc-Clurevar.pubescensP.F.Li或淡竹Phyllostachysnigra（Lodd.）Munrovar.henonis（Mitf.）StapfexRendle的茎秆的干燥中间层。全年均可采制，取新鲜茎，除去外皮，将稍带绿色的中间层刮成丝条，或削成薄片，捆扎成束，阴干。前者称“散竹茹”，后者称“齐竹茹”。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-59nr3mp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-59nr3mp","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】本品为卷曲成团的不规则丝条或呈长条形薄片状。宽窄厚薄不等，浅绿色或黄绿色。体轻松，质柔韧，有弹性。气微，味淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-b2uxn4j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-b2uxn4j","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-clsfs97","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-clsfs97","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"竹茹：除去杂质，切段或揉成小团。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-pxkwzq0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-pxkwzq0","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"姜竹茹：取净竹茹，照姜汁炙法（附录ⅡD）炒至黄色。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-jzf3bpo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-jzf3bpo","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《全国中草药汇编》－－－姜竹茹：取生姜，捣碎，加水少许，压榨取汁，将姜汁洒于竹茹上，拌匀，用小火微炒，取出，晾干即得（每100斤，用生姜10斤）。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-bc08rvv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-bc08rvv","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】甘，微寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-zpf6ugm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-zpf6ugm","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归肺、胃经。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-o5rb39s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-o5rb39s","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】清热化痰，除烦止呕。用于痰热咳嗽，胆火挟痰，烦热呕吐，惊悸失眼，中风痰迷，舌强不语，胃热呕吐，妊娠恶阻，胎动不安。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-ryte0ie","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-ryte0ie","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】4.5～9g。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-4xnlnj9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-4xnlnj9","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【贮藏】置干燥处，防霉，防蛀。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-akp9620","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-akp9620","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-jb37kd0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-jb37kd0","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"竹茹《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-wrwakje","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-wrwakje","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】ZhúRú"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-js3w2ac","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-js3w2ac","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】CaulisBambusaeinTaeniam"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-h075mvw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-h075mvw","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为禾本科植物青秆竹BambusatuldoidesMunro茎的中间层。全年均可采制，取新鲜茎，除去外皮，将稍带绿色的中间层刮成丝条，或削成薄条，捆扎成束，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-9bnr8tl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-9bnr8tl","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】单丛生。秆高6～8m，直径3～4.5cm。节间壁厚，长30～36cm，幼时被白粉。节稍隆起。分枝常于秆基部第一节开始分出，数枝簇生节上。秆箨早落。箨鞘背面无毛，干时肋纹稍缍起，先端呈不对称的拱形，外侧一边稍下斜至箨鞘全长的1/10～1/8。箨耳稍不等大，靠外侧1枚稍大，卵形，略波褶，边缘被波曲状刚毛，小的1枚椭圆形。箨舌高2.5～3.5mm，边缘被短流苏毛，片直，呈不对称三角形或狭三角形，基部两侧与耳相连，连接部分宽约0.5mm。叶披针形至狭披针形，长10～18cm，宽11～17mm，背面密生短柔毛。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-n7bg9pj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-n7bg9pj","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】生于山坡、路旁或栽培。主产广东、海南。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-x1d426d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-x1d426d","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】本品为不规则的丝条，卷曲成团或长条形薄片。宽窄厚薄不等，浅绿色或黄绿色。体轻松，质柔韧，有弹性。气微，味淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-154uj4m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-154uj4m","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】含木质素、纤维素。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-p373jyn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-p373jyn","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】性微寒，味甘。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-dnnqy21","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-dnnqy21","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】清热化痰，除烦止呕。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-5fjy11n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-5fjy11n","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-s3f87am","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-s3f87am","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"竹茹《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-ykyqdq7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-ykyqdq7","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-wl6p5ox","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-wl6p5ox","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】ZhúRú"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-57hgsiw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-57hgsiw","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】竹皮（《金匮要略》），青竹茹（《本草经集注》），淡竹皮茹（《别录》），淡竹茹（《食疗本草》），麻巴（《草木便方》），竹二青（《上海常用中草药》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-7it3i2i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-7it3i2i","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为禾本科植物淡竹的茎秆除去外皮后刮下的中间层。砍取茎秆，刮去外层皮，然后将中间层刮成丝状，晾干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-b08b58x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-b08b58x","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-ytgxptc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-ytgxptc","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡竹（《本草图经》），又名：水竹（《纲日》），甘竹（《群芳谱》），金竹花（《植物名汇》），光苦竹、钓鱼竹、白夹竹、如金竹、杜圆竹、斑真竹、荆竹、罗汉竹。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-8z93v7t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-8z93v7t","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多年生常绿乔木或灌木。秆高7～18米，直径3～10厘米，圆筒形，绿色，无毛，分枝之一侧节间有宽5～10毫米之纵槽，秆环及箨环均甚隆起。秆箨长于节间，硬纸质，背面无毛或具微毛，稻草色有灰黑色之斑点及条纹；箨耳显着；箨舌发达；箨叶长披针形，鲜绿色，先端渐尖，基部收缩。主枝三棱形或微作四方形，具白色蜡粉；小枝上端有叶1～3枚。叶鞘淡绿色或稻草色，通常无毛；叶舌短，棕色；叶片质薄，狭披针形，长7.5～16厘米，宽1～2厘米，先端渐尖，基部收缩为长约5毫米之叶柄，边缘一侧平滑，一侧具小锯齿；表面深绿色，无毛，背面较淡，基部具微毛；穗状花序小枝排列成覆瓦状的圆锥花序；花枝有叶。顶生小穗丛1～3枚，基部托以4～6枚佛焰苞；小穗含2～3花，顶端花退化；颖1或2片，披针形，具微毛；外稃锐尖，表面有微毛；内稃先端有2齿，生微毛；鳞被3～1，或缺如，披针形，长约3毫米；雄蕊3，花丝甚长，悬垂于花外；子房尖卵形，花柱丝状，柱头3枚。笋期4～5月。花期10月至次年二月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-jses0eo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-jses0eo","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本植物的根茎（淡竹根）、苗（淡竹笋）、箨叶（淡竹壳）、叶（竹叶）、卷而未放的幼叶（竹卷心）、茎秆经烤灼后流出的液汁（竹沥）、枯死的幼竹茎秆（仙人杖）亦供药用，各详专条。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-4l8aoub","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-4l8aoub","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】通常栽植于庭园。分布长江流域。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-cwrlwt0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-cwrlwt0","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】为丝状条片，长短不等，卷曲扭缩作螺旋形，外表黄绿色或淡黄白色，粗糙。质柔韧，有弹性。气清香，味淡。以色黄绿、丝均匀，细软者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-z8520dp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-z8520dp","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】姜汁炒竹茹：每斤竹茹用生姜2两，榨汁去滓，再加开水2两，与竹茹充分拌匀，置锅内微炒，取出，晾干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-ecjdq0b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-ecjdq0b","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-0w0541a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-0w0541a","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘，凉。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-ajpuffz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-ajpuffz","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《别录》：\"微寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-qp8d86t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-qp8d86t","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《药性论》：\"甘。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-o489hnq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-o489hnq","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《纲目》：\"甘，微寒，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-qud1sv4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-qud1sv4","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《药品化义》：\"味苦，性凉。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-zt3n25t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-zt3n25t","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《本草再新》：\"味甘辛，性微寒，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-ixh0vfs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-ixh0vfs","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-yn5a2pu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-yn5a2pu","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入胃、胆经。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-28ty8tk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-28ty8tk","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草经疏》：\"入足阳明胃经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-7afae4z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-7afae4z","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《药品化义》：\"入胆、胃二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-jvqtxol","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-jvqtxol","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草经解》：\"入膀胱、脾经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-musp8of","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-musp8of","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本草求真》：\"入肺、胃。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-vpjem8r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-vpjem8r","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《本草再新》：\"入心、肺二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-6lhg8q8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-6lhg8q8","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-ezhmdxa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-ezhmdxa","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"清热，凉血，化痰，止吐。治烦热呕吐、呃逆，痰热咳喘，吐血，衄血，崩漏，恶阻，眙动，惊痫。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-eikwmt5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-eikwmt5","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《别录》：\"主呕畹，温气寒热，吐血，崩中溢筋。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-9m23bke","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-9m23bke","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《药性论》：\"止肺痿唾血，鼻衄，治五痔。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-ir1susi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-ir1susi","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《食疗本草》：\"主噎膈，鼻衄。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-nfkg934","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-nfkg934","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本草蒙筌》：\"主胃热呃逆，疗噎膈呕哕。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-j4x9bze","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-j4x9bze","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《纲目》：\"治伤寒劳复，小儿热痢，妇人胎动。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-uyaa2nc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-uyaa2nc","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《本草正》：\"治肺痿唾痰，吐血，妇人血热崩淋，胎动，及小儿风热癫痫，痰气喘咳，小水热涩。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-1llljpk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-1llljpk","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《本草述》：\"除胃烦不眠，疗妊娠烦躁。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-jof5nuv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-jof5nuv","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨《本单再新》：\"泻火除烦，润肺开郁，化痰凉血，止吐血，化水血，消痈痿肿毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-ai7z152","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-ai7z152","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，1.5～3钱。外用：熬膏贴。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-qfaxwol","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-qfaxwol","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】《本草经疏》：\"胃寒呕吐：及感寒挟食作吐忌用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-5mzbgja","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-5mzbgja","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-f81dltr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-f81dltr","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治哕逆：橘皮二斤，竹茹二升，大枣三十枚，生姜半斤，甘草五两，人参一两。上六味，以水一斗，煮取三升，温服一升，日三服。（《金匮要略》橘皮竹茹汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-erfvme9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-erfvme9","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治妊娠恶阻呕吐，不下食："}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-rm65v4c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-rm65v4c","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"青竹茹、橘皮各十八铢，茯芩、生姜各一两，半夏三十铢。上五味以水六升，煮取二升半，分三服，不瘥，频作。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-1g9ljq7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-1g9ljq7","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治妇人乳中虚，烦乱呕逆，安中益气：生竹茹二分，石膏二分，桂枝一分，甘草七分，白薇一分。上五味，末之，枣肉和丸弹子大。以饮服一丸，日三夜二服。有热者倍白薇，烦喘者加柏实一分。（《金匮要隙》竹皮大丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-nvjinsk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-nvjinsk","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治产后虚烦，头痛短气欲绝，心中闷乱不解：生淡竹茹一升，麦门冬五合，甘草一两，小麦五合，生姜三两，大枣十四枚。上六味以水一斗，煮竹茹、小麦，取八升，去滓，乃纳诸药，煮取一升，去滓，分二服，羸人分作三服。（《千金方》淡竹茹汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-wf16es9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-wf16es9","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治大病后，虚烦不得眠：半夏（汤洗七次）、竹茹、枳实（麸炒，去穰）各二两，陈皮三两，甘草一两（炙），茯苓一两半。上为锉散，每服四大钱，水一盏半，姜五片，枣一枚，煎七分，去滓，食前服。（《三因方》温胆汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-leyyxj6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-leyyxj6","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治伤暑烦渴不止：竹茹一合（新竹者），甘草一分（锉），乌梅两枚（椎破）。上三味，同用水一盏半，煎取八分，去滓放温，时时细呷。（《圣济总录》竹茹汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-0lsknwg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-0lsknwg","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治肺热咳嗽，咳吐黄痰：竹二青三钱。水煎服。（《上海常用中草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-2cffzjz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-2cffzjz","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治小儿痫：青竹茹三两，醋三升，煎一升，去滓，服一合。兼治小儿口噤体热病。（《子母秘录》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-c9nq4ic","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-c9nq4ic","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治妇人病未平复，因有所动，致热气上冲胸，手足拘急搐搦，如中风状：栝楼根二两，淡竹茹半升。上以水二升半，煮取一升二合，去滓，分作二、三服。（《类证活人书》青竹茹汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-3vjs9nq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-3vjs9nq","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治齿龈间血出不止：生竹茹二两，醋煮含之。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-y1cjmlp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-y1cjmlp","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治黄泡热疮：真麻油二两，青木香二两，青竹茹一小闭，杏仁二十粒（去皮、尖）。上药入麻油内，慢火煎令杏仁黄色，去渣，入松脂（研）半两，熬成膏，每用少许擦疮上。（《济生方》竹茹膏）"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-1npdy46","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-1npdy46","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【备注】据文献记载，除上述淡竹茹外，供药用者尚有苦竹茹、慈竹茹等，各详专条。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-wh3rgxk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-wh3rgxk","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-jz4dle0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-jz4dle0","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"竹茹《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-v5hvtxy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-v5hvtxy","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-fyct7od","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-fyct7od","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.出自《本草经集注》（《中药大辞典》）、《别录》（《中华药海》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-i4tqxm5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-i4tqxm5","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草图经》：堇竹、淡竹、苦竹，《本经》并不载所出州土，今处处有之。竹之类甚多，而入药者惟此三种，人多不能尽别。甘竹似篁而茂，即淡竹也。淡竹肉薄，节间有粉，南人以烧竹沥者，医家只用此一品，与《竹谱》所说，大同而小异也。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-qhx89jg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-qhx89jg","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】ZhúRú"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-e1x57mv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-e1x57mv","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】BambooShavings"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-ulm1osk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-ulm1osk","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】竹皮、淡竹皮茹、青竹茹、淡竹茹、麻巴、竹二青、竹子青"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-a9dncvw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-a9dncvw","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-6mc42d0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-6mc42d0","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为禾本科植物淡竹、青竿竹、大头典竹等的茎秆去外皮刮出的中间层。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-glohupt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-glohupt","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：1.Phyllostachylnigra(Lodd.exLindl.)Munrovar.henonis(Mitf.)StapfetRendle2.BambusatuldoidesMunro.3.Sinocalamusbeecheyanus(Munro)McClurevar.pubescensP.F.Li[BambusabeecheyanaMunrovar.pubescensP.E.Li；Dendrocalamopsisbeecheyana(Munro)Kengf.var.pubescens(P.F.Li)Kengf.]"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-5e4sez3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-5e4sez3","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：冬季砍伐当年生长的新竹，除去枝叶，锯成段，刮去外层青皮，然后将中间层刮成丝状，摊放晾干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-2ot2w3r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-2ot2w3r","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】1.淡竹植株木质化，呈乔木状。竿高6-18m，直径5-7cm，成长后仍为绿色，或老时为灰绿色，竿环及箨环均甚隆起。箨鞘背面无毛或上部具微毛，黄绿至淡黄色而具有灰黑色之斑点和条纹；箨耳及其繸毛均极易脱落；箨叶长披针形，有皱折，基部收缩；小技具叶1-5片，叶鞘鞘口无毛；叶片深绿色，无毛，窄披针形，宽1-2cm，次脉6-8对，质薄。穗状花序小技排列成覆瓦状的圆锥花序；小穗含2-3花，顶端花退化，颖工或2片，披针形，具微毛；外稃锐尖，表面有微毛；内稃先端有2齿，生微毛，长12-15mm；鳞被数目有变化，3至1枚或缺如，披钍形，长约3mm；花药长7-10mm，开花时，以具有甚长之花丝而垂悬于花外；子房呈尖卵形，顶生一长形之花柱，两者共长约7mm，柱头3枚，各长约smm，呈帚刷状。笋期4-5月，花期10月至次年5月。2.青竿竹植株木质化，呈乔木状。植株丛生，无刺。竿直立或近直立，高达15m，径约6cm。顶端不弯垂，竿的节上分枝较多；节间圆柱形，竿的节间和箨光滑无毛。3.大头典竹植株木质化，是乔木状。竿高达15m。多少有些作之字形折曲，幼竿被毛和中部以下的竿节上通常具毛环，节间通常较短；箨鞘背部疏被黑褐色、贴生前向刺毛；释片基部较狭；释舌较长，长约5mm；小穗通常呈麦秆黄色；内稃背部被柔毛，脊上具较长而密的缘毛。叶鞘通常被毛；叶舌较长以及外稃背面被疏柔毛。花期3-5月，笋期6-7月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-0jr83r0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-0jr83r0","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-y3vh2f2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-y3vh2f2","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：1.淡竹通常栽植于庭园。2．青竿竹多生于平地、丘陵。3．大头典竹生于山坡、平地工路旁。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-cojbj88","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-cojbj88","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：1.淡竹分布于山东、河南、及长江流域以南各地。2．青竿竹分布于广东、广西。3．大头典竹分布于广东、海南及广西。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-0o8z2a3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-0o8z2a3","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【栽培】"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-3ljo9a1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-3ljo9a1","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生物学特性淡竹：喜温暖潮湿气候，忌严寒及强风。宜选择背风向阳山坡、村庄附近缓坡平地及水旁栽种。以湿润、肥沃、排水良好中性或微酸性、微碱性的砂质填土栽培，不宜在瘠薄、粘重的土壤上栽种。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-udh2asz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-udh2asz","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培技术用母竹移栽。2月中旬至3月下旬，选择竹竿健壮、节间稠密、分枝矮、枝叶茂盛、竹鞭生长势强、粗壮、鞭芽新鲜、芽饱满新鲜、无病虫害的二年生竹为母竹。挖掘长60cm、宽40cm、深30cm的根盘，2-3株或多至5株均可，挖母付时应多带鞭根及泥土，不损伤芽胞及须根，切口要砍平，搬运时用稻草包裹。竹梢要切去一部分，留4-7丛丫枝，按行林距5m×3m挖穴。穴比原来根盘稍大，将竹栽入穴内。先填入一层细表土或塘泥。立正竹株，覆土分层踏实，并浇透水，培土，防止水分蒸发，并固定竹株。为防止风吹摇动，用支柱四周撑扶固定。田间管理移栽母竹成活后要除草松土。除雨季及冬季外，均要经常浇水，保持土壤湿润。竹喜氮肥，其所需氮、磷、钾肥比例为5：1：2。一般追肥2-3次，以勤施少施为原则。病虫害防治病害有竹锈病，为害叶片。发病初期可喷洒波尔多液防治。虫害有竹大象虫，为害竹笋，在成虫交尾、产卵期，可进行人工捕捉：幼虫孵化期，用90%晶体敌百虫500倍液喷杀。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-40xf4ua","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-40xf4ua","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】性状鉴别本品呈不规则的丝状或薄带状，常卷曲扭缩而缠结成团或作创花状，长短不一，宽0.5-0.7cm，厚0.3-0.5cm。全体淡黄白色、浅绿色、青黄色、灰黄色、灰黄绿色、黄而韧，有弹性。气稍清香，味微甜。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-czk91lg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-czk91lg","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】淡竹的竹茹含有对cAMP磷酸二酯酶抑制作用的成分：2，5-二甲氧基-对-羟基苯甲醛（p-hydroxybenzaldehyde），丁香醛（syringaldehyde），松柏醛（coniferylaldehyde）。另含对苯二甲酸2'-羟乙基甲基酯（1，4-benzenedicarboxylicacid2'-hydroxyethylmethylester）。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-1pra407","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-1pra407","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-xz8emu5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-xz8emu5","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.增加尿中氯化物量:有增加尿中氯化物量的作用；2.增高血糖:此外，还有增高血糖作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-qyj77u3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-qyj77u3","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.抗菌作用:竹茹粉在平皿上对白色葡萄球菌、枯草杆菌、大肠杆菌及伤寒杆蓖等有较强的抗菌作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-jd0h2qi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-jd0h2qi","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-rnq118s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-rnq118s","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.净制：除去杂质。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-9vudn1x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-9vudn1x","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.切制：除去杂质切揉成小团，将竹茹中的碎末，过粗箩，收集粗粉。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-rmrhoer","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-rmrhoer","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.姜汁炒：取净竹茹，加姜汁拌匀，置之不理锅内用文火炒至黄色，取出，晾干。每斤竹茹用生姜3两。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-5j447hp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-5j447hp","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.姜汁焙：取净竹茹，加姜汁拌匀，稍闷，压平，置锅内，用文火加热，炒焙至两面显黄色焦斑，取出，晾干。每竹茹100kg，用生姜10kg或干姜3kg。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-imp19ey","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-imp19ey","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.炒制：先将锅烧热，放入麦麸，炒至冒烟，加入竹茹翻炒至黄色，筛去麦麸即可。每竹茹10kg，用麦麸2kg。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-66cvrkw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-66cvrkw","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.砂制：取竹茹抖去灰渣，加飞朱砂细粉1%兑水适量搅匀后，喷晒竹茹，至染成均匀红色，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-qgqg682","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-qgqg682","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】甘；微寒"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-i783b3j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-i783b3j","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】脾；胃；胆经"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-u2hcfs1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-u2hcfs1","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】清热化痰；除烦止呕；安胎凉血。主肺热咳嗽；烦热惊悸；胃热呕呃；妊娠恶阻；胎动不安；吐血；衄血；尿血；崩漏"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-b1mnt28","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-b1mnt28","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，5-10g；或入丸、散。外用：适量，熬膏贴。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-yo17hmn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-yo17hmn","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】寒痰咳喘、胃寒呕逆及脾虚泄泻者禁服。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-7bmo6ph","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-7bmo6ph","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】1.竹茹汤(《普济本事方》)，温中降逆，主治胃热呕吐，症见呕吐酸腐，食入即吐，脘腹胀满，口臭而渴，嗳气厌食，舌黄脉数。2.涤痰汤(《济生方》)，涤痰开窍，主治中风痰迷心窍，舌强不能言。3.温胆汤(《三因极一病症方论》)，理气化痰，清胆和胃，主治胆胃不和，痰热内扰，虚烦不眠，或呕吐呃逆，以及惊悸不宁，癫痫等症。4.黄连温胆汤(《六因条辨》)，清热除烦，理气化痰，主治痰热内扰，失眠，眩晕，心烦，口苦，舌苔黄腻。5.羚羊钩藤汤(《通俗伤寒论》)，凉肝熄风，增液舒筋，主治肝经热盛，热极动风，高热不退，烦闷躁扰，手足抽搐，发为痉厥，甚则神昏，舌绛而干，或舌焦起刺，脉弦而数。6.桔皮竹茹汤(《金匮要略》)，主治胃中热盛，气逆上冲。7.竹皮大丸(《金匮要略》)，治妇人乳中虚，烦乱呕逆，安中益气。8.竹茹汤(《圣济总录》)，治伤暑烦渴不止。9.淡竹茹汤(《千金方》)，治产后虚烦，头痛短气欲绝，心中闷乱不解。10.竹茹膏(《济生方》)，治黄泡热疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-uh7yax3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-uh7yax3","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-8aom0if","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-8aom0if","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《别录》：主呕啘，温气寒热，吐血，崩中溢筋。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-fqbzoer","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-fqbzoer","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《药性论》：止肺痿唾血，鼻衄，治五痔。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-ig0b92z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-ig0b92z","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《食疗本草》：主噎膈，鼻衄。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-29cubvn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-29cubvn","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《本草蒙筌》：主胃热呃逆，疗噎膈呕哕。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-f7e67ew","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-f7e67ew","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《纲目》：治伤寒劳复，小儿热癎，妇人胎动。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-nmkbbhh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-nmkbbhh","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《本草正》：治肺痿唾痰，尿血，妇人血热崩淋，胎动，及小儿风热癫癎，痰气喘咳，小水热涩。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-5ib8q1j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-5ib8q1j","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《本草述》：除胃烦不眠，疗妊娠烦躁。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-wtjoxst","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-wtjoxst","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《本草再新》：泻火除烦，润肺开郁，化痰凉血，止吐血，化瘀血，消痈痿肿毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-5es5kc3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-5es5kc3","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.《本草经疏》：《经》曰，诸呕吐酸水，皆属于热。阳明有热，则为呕啘；温气寒热，亦邪客阳明所致。竹茹，甘寒解阳明之热，则邪气退而呕啘止矣。甘寒又能凉血清热，故主吐血崩中及女劳复也。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-ztaeu1j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-ztaeu1j","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10.《药品化义》：竹茹，轻可去实，凉能去热，苦能降下，专清热痰，为宁神开郁佳品。主治胃热噎膈，胃虚干呕，热呃咳逆，痰热恶心，酒伤呕吐，痰涎酸水，惊悸怔忡，心烦躁乱，睡卧不宁，此皆胆胃热痰之症，悉能奏效。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-xhmv3ea","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-xhmv3ea","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11.《本经逢原》：竹茹专清胃府之热，为虚烦烦渴、胃虚呕逆之要药；咳逆唾血，产后虚烦，无不宜之。《金匮》治产后虚烦呕逆，有竹皮大丸。《千金》治产后内虚，烦热短气，有甘竹茹汤；产后虚烦头痛，短气，闷乱不解，有淡竹茹汤。内虚用甘以安中，闷乱用淡以清胃，各有至理存焉。其性虽寒而滑能利窍，可无郁遏客邪之虑。"}]},{"ID":"20240902144615-cmu20mp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144615-cmu20mp","updated":"20240902144647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902144617-1gh96pg","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240902144617-1gh96pg","updated":"20240902144647"}},{"ID":"20240902144618-5zylbws","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902144618-5zylbws","updated":"20240902144647"}}]}